# Research Plan: masothue.com Structure

## Progress Tracking
- [x] Check robots.txt (Allows everything except /Ajax/*)
- [x] Explore homepage for Industry and Province links
- [/] Analyze Industry URL pattern: `https://masothue.com/tra-cuu-ma-so-thue-theo-nganh-nghe/`
- [/] Analyze Province URL pattern: `https://masothue.com/tra-cuu-ma-so-thue-theo-tinh/`
