## Findings
- **robots.txt**: `User-Agent: * Allow: / Disallow: /Ajax/*`
- **Homepage**: Contains "Ngành nghề" (Industry) and "Tỉnh / Thành phố" (Province) menu items.
- **URL Patterns**:
  - Industry list: `https://masothue.com/tra-cuu-ma-so-thue-theo-nganh-nghe/`
  - Province list: `https://masothue.com/tra-cuu-ma-so-thue-theo-tinh/`
- **Anti-scraping noticed**: Persistent modal "Xem thêm nội dung" requiring an ad view to access full site content. This modal appears on both homepage and subpages.
- **Province links (partial)**: An Giang, Bà Rịa - Vũng Tàu, Bắc Giang, etc. Links likely follow a slug pattern.
